0..75 Comment "// The sessions subject\'s shared declarations, written once and imported by"
76..150 Comment "// every source that reads them (`import \"./seat-base.gandr\" ;`): a seat\'s"
151..220 Comment "// protocol as a recursive session type (Honda, Vasconcelos and Kubo,"
221..279 Comment "// _Language Primitives and Type Discipline for Structured"
280..355 Comment "// Communication-Based Programming_, doi:10.1007/BFb0053567) — a dispatch"
356..432 Comment "// received, then reports and the choice to continue or retire, or a handoff"
433..487 Comment "// that ends it — and the messages a seat exchanges."
489..563 Comment "/// A seat: its message types sealed behind the interface, the protocol it"
564..638 Comment "/// serves, and one message of each type. A report is marked `mobile`: its"
639..710 Comment "/// representation may cross from the seat\'s world back to the one that"
711..767 Comment "/// dispatched it (`../worlds/seat-and-operator.gandr`)."
